[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_TELESCOPE]
Telescope

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_TELESCOPE_desc]
A telescope has a much stronger reconnaissance capability than a binocular... Wait, don’t directly point it at the enemy’s position! You won’t see anything like that!
The true principle is that a telescope can observe the night sky more clearly, so we can use astrology to more accurately predict the enemy’s movements.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_TELESCOPE]
天文望远镜

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_TELESCOPE_desc]
天文望远镜的侦查能力远强于普通望远镜... 当然不是让你把天文望远镜对着敌军阵地！那样你什么都看不到！
原理其实是，天文望远镜可以更加清晰地观测星空，因此我们使用占星术就可以更加精准的预测敌军的行动。
